Subject: CPMS I03E4 Activation Source Topology Data Design

@ [design_uuid] 747ccdcb-b2ba-4b54-a9b7-6863c527c284
@ [source_uuid] bcd3f900-8f3a-4be1-bea5-b4e84d553ee8

& [CanonicalInputBinding] fields
  + slice_id path bytes sha256 specification_uuid authority_state requirement_count implemented_count verified_count lock_identity

& [AuthoritySnapshot] fields
  + baseline_commit completed_predecessors inactive_candidates missing_signatures host_blocks coordination_blocks trust_blocks fixture_blocks

& [SourceSurface] fields
  + path surface_class baseline_bytes baseline_sha256 exists owner shared mutation_policy forbidden_content
  + surface_class workspace_manifest workspace_lock crate_manifest crate_ledger conformance_ledger exclusive_module focused_test or fixture

& [ModuleOwnership] fields
  + module_class unit_id semantic_owner source_path test_path feature_gate imports exports forbidden_dependencies

& [ActivationUnit] fields
  + unit_id specification_binding authority_state hard_predecessors governance_predecessors integration_predecessors exclusive_surfaces shared_deltas requirements gates forbidden_scope disposition

& [DependencyEdge] fields
  + predecessor_unit successor_unit kind consumed_identity rationale disposition
  + kind hard_prerequisite governance_order integration_order or evidence_dependency

& [TouchLeaseCandidate] fields
  + lease_id unit_id active_lock predecessor_path predecessor_bytes predecessor_sha256 allowed_anchors max_added_lines max_removed_lines semantic_owner steward status successor_digest
  + status proposed issued consumed refused stale or superseded

& [InterfaceReceipt] fields
  + unit_id module_path module_sha256 feature_gate exported_symbols imported_symbols fault_vocabulary resource_profile forbidden_dependencies test_inventory review_identity disposition

& [FixtureRecord] fields
  + fixture_id path role bytes sha256 generator_id generator_input_digest predecessor_digest owner_unit expectation_receipt review_identity
  + role source_seed mutation_proposal reviewed_expectation observation or comparison_golden

& [GateObservation] fields
  + unit_id gate_id stage command_digest environment_digest artifact_digest policy_identity disposition evidence_ref predecessor_observation
  + disposition observed_pass observed_fail observed_blocked not_run stale or not_applicable

& [UnitCompletionEnvelope] fields
  + unit_id specification_digest source_inventory_digest requirement_status_digest review_digest satisfaction_digest active_lock_digest evidence_closure_digest disposition

& [TopologyEnvelope] fields
  + profile source_digest baseline_commit input_bindings authority_snapshot surfaces owners units edges lease_candidates fixture_root limits blockers disposition digest

& [FiniteLimits] before future activation
  + at most 16 canonical inputs
  + exactly 8 unit identities
  + at most 64 dependency edges
  + at most 64 source surfaces
  + at most 16 shared ledgers
  + at most 128 lease records including successors
  + at most 256 imports and 256 exports per unit
  + at most 65536 fixture records
  + at most 4096 gate observations
  + paths at most 1024 UTF-8 bytes and rationale at most 4096 UTF-8 bytes
  + checked arithmetic governs every count byte total and allocation

& [Indexes] are deterministic
  + by_unit by_path by_owner by_dependency_successor by_dependency_predecessor by_lease_status by_fixture_role by_gate_disposition
  + every index reconstructs from primary records and grants no separate authority

& [CanonicalEncoding] is UTF-8 fixed field order lexical record order normalized slash-separated repository-relative paths and domain-separated SHA256
& [DataBoundary] formation defines record shapes and limits but creates zero runtime records leases fixtures executions signatures or implementation artifacts
& [DesignDisposition] is complete_for_canonical_formation
